.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt RM 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm rm
.Nd remove files and directories
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl rf
.Ar path ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility removes each
.Ar path .
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl f
Ignore a missing operand.
.It Fl r
Recurse into directories and remove their contents before the directory itself.
.El
.Pp
A directory without
.Fl r
is an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rmdir 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
